{"id":"fd6ba658cdd47516","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dnfsat.md","title":"Polynomial solvability of DNF-SAT","display":"thm-dnfsat — Polynomial solvability of DNF-SAT","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dnfsat","aliases":["27-thm-dnfsat"],"display":"thm-dnfsat — Polynomial solvability of DNF-SAT","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-classP]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.2, discussion of DNF equations with right-hand side 1","source_printed_pages":"74","source_pdf_pages":"98","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dnfsat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dnfsat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnfsat — Polynomial solvability of DNF-SAT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.2, discussion of DNF equations with right-hand side 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"74"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"98"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>；编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\)</span> 为下式定义的二进制语言符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>合法项均非零，解析后只需检查项集非空。解析、合法性检查和项数检查相对于显式编码长度均为多项式；非法码拒绝。这里是 DNF 值为 1 的 SAT，不能与本书 DNF 值为 0 的方程一致性复杂度混淆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classP","status":"resolved","id":"65c23d4db160ede7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-classP]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]；编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf P$ 见 [[27-df-classP]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]；编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf P$ 见 [[27-df-classP]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classP","status":"resolved","id":"65c23d4db160ede7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]；编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathbf P$ 见 [[27-df-classP]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{DNFSAT}$ 为下式定义的二进制语言符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.","display":true}],"bytes":1462,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-404","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-dnfsat|thm-dnfsat — Polynomial solvability of DNF-SAT]]"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","42004383fb23d1fe","65c23d4db160ede7"]}